	)
	(text "PWMk (1 = switch on) -> RS-422 pair, terminated on the power board. 10k pull-downs: ePWM balls are\ninputs without pull-up during reset/boot (table 6-6), so every gate command is 0 until firmware runs.\nG = C1_DRV_EN, G~ high: outputs high impedance unless CHB_OK, C1_EN_MCU and RDY are high (INT-15).\nePWM1-4 have high-resolution PWM: the dual-active bridge (phase shift at 100 kHz) must use ports C1 and\nC2, one bridge per port."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 262.176 108.56 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b223e703-9845-5270-b03b-737b7a0b6b6e")
	)
	(text "ANALOG FRONT ENDS AN1-AN3 (OPA4388), DUAL RANGE"
